#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:80
#: 80800c32f5d841c181296db70d92d7c3
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:82
#: 5c46b50d720d40779140e44d71991a68
msgid "RC input is configured on the RX2 (UART2_RX) pin. It supports all RC protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL 2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` is set to \"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:84
#: 3ca6ec9dcf064a37bea030a537e0e7b4
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX2 pin but SBUS requires that the :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:86
#: 84faacb4a58346fc8c2b35f8a9d89caa
msgid "FPort requires connection to TX2 and :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` be set to \"7\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:88
#: 812a0aa82ed5426b9ed829a83f4b67bb
msgid "CRSF also requires a TX2 connection, in addition to RX2, and automatically provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:90
#: 8e71d59884f54571ac3ad98edbde6f1b
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to TX2 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:92
#: 23fa71bebffb4781b3df1e242d0a4c0d
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:95
#: 7d50a6d9962040eea48a7ebe3cf7ca5f
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:97
#: d4e2e6e737804be3bd3fc48ffc774ad2
msgid "The autopilot supports 5 PWM outputs. The first four outputs are directly connected to the integrated ESC. The 5th is defaulted for NeoPixel LED use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:99
#: 1d1066487bfe4d48afe20d1cdddf1032
msgid "The PWM are in 2 groups: 1-4, and 5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:101
#: 6bc686e5e2ad4308a553351ce729a4de
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate and protocol. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use DShot. Outputs 1-4 support bidirectional DShot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:105
#: 8f43491cc5b84e21a11256b5cced6be1
msgid "for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default parameters:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:107
#: 73ae600cffd84d07a55f825c4778650b
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:108
#: 216d6bb8623144be86b01898eed6673a
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:112
#: d4da98cdb1494c2d84d4c6c4572e73e6
msgid "Integrated ESC Setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:114
#: 281a99c3f2f145d0b019a2752e3523d2
msgid "By default the following parameters are setup for a Copter vehicle to give Bi-Directional DShot600 protocol and BLHeli Passthrough capability to the first four outputs which drive the ESC:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:116
#: d171192d7e424381abda4b62aa5f6518
msgid ":ref:`SERVO_BLH_BDMASK<SERVO_BLH_BDMASK>` =  15 (outputs 1-4 are bi-directional BLHeli)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:117
#: 8fa8968559bb4f8eaa718b10ad0eef3c
msgid ":ref:`SERVO_BLH_AUTO<SERVO_BLH_AUTO>` =  1 (enable automatically enabling BLHeli passthrough on outputs 1 -4)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:118
#: 9ffed45f84334ece88678c2995eefa86
msgid ":ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE<MOT_PWM_TYPE>` = 6 (set DShot 600 protocol)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:120
#: 0286f48cbc7749569796ea171151a7e9
msgid "for QuadPlane Copter Tailsitters, set :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE<Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` = 6, since :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE<MOT_PWM_TYPE>` only applies to Copters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:123
